:seed: iva-evidence-2026
@step Create the declaration for the filing target.
aeat app modelo work create --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@step Calculate the quarter's VAT from the classified records.
aeat app modelo work calculate --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T --no-joint-return-elected
@step Check the calculated draft.
aeat --format json app modelo work verify --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@expect result.granted_verificado_completo == true
@step Export the file in the official record format. Its envelope carries Cadrumo's all-zero development software identity, so AEAT will not accept it for presentation.
@result aeat --format json app modelo export --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T --output modelo-303.boe
@expect exit_code == 0
@expect result.software_identity_grade == "development_mock"
